/* 
  sgstubs_fixed.ldt - intentionally empty.

  This file overrides the IDE's default sgstubs_fixed.ldt to suppress the
  auto-generated ".gnu.sgstubs > SG_veneer_table" placement (no AT>, stubs
  would land in flash with LMA == VMA, breaking the runtime copy).

  The actual .gnu.sgstubs placement - with AT> ${CODE} so the load image is
  in flash and the run-time address is in SG_veneer_table SRAM - is handled
  by the project-level sgstubs.ldt included alongside this file.
*/
